# When this file exists, Vercel uses it (not .gitignore) to decide what to upload
# on `vercel deploy`. The owner snapshot is GITIGNORED but MUST reach the owner
# deployment, so it is intentionally NOT listed here. The local SQLite database,
# environment files, and build output must never be uploaded -- they are.
#
# This file governs EVERY deployment. An earlier version of this comment claimed
# the public deployment bypassed it via `vercel deploy --prebuilt` from GitHub
# Actions; there is no .github/ directory in this repo and no CI of any kind, so
# nothing bypasses these rules. Both channels are hand-run from this tree with
# the Vercel CLI. If a prebuilt or CI path is ever added, update this comment in
# the same change -- a stale exemption note here is how an upload rule gets
# assumed away.

node_modules
.next
.git
.vercel

# Local-only data & secrets -- never upload.
data
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.env
.env.*

# AI assistant / local tooling files.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude
.cursorrules
.pre-push-review-passed
.release-test-passed
